OL,3,GNEWSAHospital faces 'significant
OL,4,Apressure' pre-winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency care services are facing
OL,7,F"significant pressures due to high
OL,8,Fdemand" going into the winter period,
OL,9,Fbosses have said.
OL,11,FAdel Jones, chief operating officer at
OL,12,FUniversity Hospitals Plymouth said
OL,13,FDerriford Hospital had seen a large
OL,14,Fnumber of patients on Monday evening.
OL,16,FDerriford, the largest hospital in the
OL,17,FSouth West which treats patients from
OL,18,Facross Cornwall and Devon, predicted it
OL,19,Fcould need an extra 122 beds for adults
OL,20,Fat the busiest point this winter.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
