OL,3,GNEWSAHospital faces 'significant
OL,4,Apressure' pre-winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FJones said: "Our teams worked hard
OL,7,Fthroughout Monday night to maintain
OL,8,Fsafe care, prioritising patients based
OL,9,Fon clinical need, and we have seen the
OL,10,Fdepartment in a much-improved
OL,11,Fposition."
